@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title GatoPago V3 — Sacar la cuenta de GatoPago

actor "Persona" as person
participant "App Web" as app COLOR_WEB
participant "App Worker" as worker COLOR_LIVE
participant "Cuenta V3" as account COLOR_EXTERNAL
participant "Wallet / multisig externa" as external COLOR_EXTERNAL
participant "Emergency client / CLI" as emergency COLOR_READY
participant "RPC / bundler público" as public_rpc COLOR_EXTERNAL

person -> app : iniciar salida
app -> worker : solicitar Portable Account Package
worker --> app : manifests, addresses, codehashes,\nchains y llaves públicas
app --> person : descarga JSON verificable

person -> external : crea/controla signer independiente
person -> app : agregar ECDSA/ERC-1271/passkey externa
app -> account : operación autorizada por threshold actual
account --> app : validator instalado
person -> external : firma operación self-funded de prueba
external -> public_rpc : UserOperation/tx sin GatoPago
public_rpc -> account : validate + execute
account --> person : prueba de control independiente

person -> emergency : importa paquete público
emergency -> public_rpc : consulta todas las chains
public_rpc --> emergency : codehash + seguridad + activos
person -> emergency : retirar asistencia / cambiar impl / sweep
emergency -> account : operaciones firmadas sin App/paymaster
account --> emergency : confirmadas

opt Cerrar perfil offchain
  person -> app : revocar sesiones y borrar perfil
  app -> worker : sólo después de verificar cada chain
end

note over person,emergency
  Una passkey no exporta su clave privada.
  Se exporta la cuenta pública y se transfiere
  control a un validator independiente.
end note

@enduml

